cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenONDA in your research, please cite it using the following metadata."
title: "OpenONDA: Operator for Numerical Design and Aerodynamics"
abstract: >-
  OpenONDA simulates incompressible viscous flows, vortex wakes, wings and
  rotors in Python with native finite-volume (FVM), vortex-particle (VPM) and
  vortex-lattice (VLM) solvers, and couples a resolved FVM near field to a
  particle wake.
type: software
version: "0.1.1"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.15111460
date-released: "2025-03-31"
authors:
  - family-names: "Martins"
    given-names: "Flavio A. C."
    affiliation: "Wind Energy Section, Faculty of Aerospace Engineering, TU Delft, The Netherlands"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1374-5760"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EngFlavioMartins/OpenONDA"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - finite volume method
  - vortex particle method
  - vortex lattice method
  - hybrid coupling
  - GPU computing
